                                                "sense_id": "6b892a4c-7f90-3a1e-ac2d-99bb43876b52",
                                                "text": "After the completion of final tests, BB-30003 went into service in September, 1959, hauling heavy express trains in the Eastern Region of the S.N.C.F. on the same schedules as the Class \"BB-16000\" locomotive fitted with S-W ignitrons."
